# This file maps the Git author names of contributors to the names listed in
# the contributors section of the release notes, see
# docs/release-notes/README.md. Each line maps all commits authored with the
# given email to the given name, as reported by git log's %aN.
#
# Add a line here, rather than editing the generated contributor list, when
# a contributor appears under several names or prefers a different one.
#
# Bot accounts that don't use GitHub's "[bot]" suffix are mapped to a name
# with that suffix, which the release notes tool leaves out of the list. The
# name is matched too, since a bot may commit with its operator's email.
